<title>USA: ATLANTA FED JULY INDEX 23.3 VS JUNE'S RVSD 15.3.</title>
<headline>ATLANTA FED JULY INDEX 23.3 VS JUNE'S RVSD 15.3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said on Tuesday its index of industry business activity surged to 23.3 in July from a revised 15.3 in June.</p>
<p>					 July		   June</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	  23.3		   15.3-R</p>
<p>Production Index		   13.1		   14.6-R</p>
<p>Prices Received		    10.9		    0.0-R</p>
<p>Prices Paid			   4.6		    7.9-R</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		  12.0		   -1.5-R</p>
<p>New Orders			   20.1		    10.8-R</p>
<p>Shipments			    26.7		    14.8-R</p>
<p>Number of Employees		 9.6		    5.8-R</p>
<p>Supplier Delivery Time	    1.1		    1.0-R</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
